{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JAS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"雅各书","commonName":"雅各书","title":"雅各书","order":59,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"790febd3f3cb0cfd86782e1d3631252e3ac92a0d653f4aa63703c9de003176b1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JAS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JAS/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":108},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["不可与世俗为友"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们中间的争战斗殴是从哪里来的呢？不是从你们百体中战斗之私欲来的吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们贪恋，还是得不着；你们杀害嫉妒，又斗殴争战，也不能得。你们得不着，是因为你们不求。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你们求也得不着，是因为你们妄求，要浪费在你们的宴乐中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你们这些淫乱的人",{"noteId":1},"哪，岂不知与世俗为友就是与 神为敌吗？所以凡想要与世俗为友的，就是与 神为敌了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们想经上所说是徒然的吗？ 神所赐、住在我们里面的灵，是恋爱至于嫉妒吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但他赐更多的恩典，所以经上说：",{"text":"神阻挡骄傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐恩给谦卑的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["故此，你们要顺服 神。务要抵挡魔鬼，魔鬼就必离开你们逃跑了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们亲近 神， 神就必亲近你们。有罪的人哪，要洁净你们的手！心怀二意的人哪，要清洁你们的心！"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们要愁苦、悲哀、哭泣，将喜笑变作悲哀，欢乐变作愁闷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["务要在主面前自卑，主就必叫你们升高。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可论断弟兄"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["弟兄们，你们不可彼此批评。人若批评弟兄，论断弟兄，就是批评律法，论断律法。你若论断律法，就不是遵行律法，乃是判断人的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["设立律法和判断人的，只有一位，就是那能救人也能灭人的。你是谁，竟敢论断别人呢？"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒自夸"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["嗐！你们有话说：「今天明天我们要往某城里去，在那里住一年，做买卖得利。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["其实明天如何，你们还不知道。你们的生命是什么呢？你们原来是一片云雾，出现少时就不见了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你们只当说：「主若愿意，我们就可以活着，也可以做这事，或做那事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["现今你们竟以张狂夸口；凡这样夸口都是恶的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["人若知道行善，却不去行，这就是他的罪了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"原文是淫妇","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JAS/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JAS/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JAS/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}